sequenceDiagram
 participant A as Application
 participant L as Logical file system
 participant D as Storage layer
 A->>L: open(path)
 L->>L: Resolve path and cache metadata
 L-->>A: Return descriptor
 A->>L: read(fd, buffer, n)
 L->>D: Resolve data blocks and request transfer
 D-->>A: Return bytes through the kernel
